# Film Halation V1.5 架构图

## 分层

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    PS["Photoshop 23.3+ / UXP<br/>app · core · imaging · action"]
    MAIN["main.jsx<br/>文档状态 · 预览调度 · 安全 Apply"]
    UI["ui/<br/>参数控件 · 1024px 面板预览"]
    IO["io/<br/>RGBA · targetSize · TRC/primaries · 行带渲染"]
    CORE["core/<br/>processFilm · processHalation · dual-PSF"]
    WASM["film_core.wasm<br/>完整 Fast 链与 blur ABI"]
    JS["纯 JavaScript 回退<br/>同参数、同 PSF"]
    STORE["storage/<br/>schema v2 · graph · strict bindings"]
    TARGET["复制的效果像素层"]
    SOURCE["绑定源像素层（只读）"]

    PS --> MAIN
    MAIN --> UI
    MAIN --> IO
    MAIN --> STORE
    SOURCE -->|getPixels RGBA| IO
    IO --> CORE
    CORE -->|Fast compact| WASM
    CORE -->|加载/执行失败| JS
    IO -->|一次 putPixels| TARGET
```

## Halation 权威链

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A["已调色显示编码 RGBA"] --> B["TRC decode + primaries → 线性 sRGB"]
    B --> C["光源提取<br/>Source Softness · alpha"]
    C --> D["红/绿/蓝感光源场<br/>蓝→红贡献受限"]
    D --> E["双尺度 PSF<br/>core 全分辨率 · tail 1/2–1/8"]
    B --> F["Background Softness<br/>局部暗侧门控"]
    E --> G["局部 Halation"]
    F --> G
    D --> H["宽半径红层 Global Diffusion<br/>独立中间调门控"]
    G --> I["HDR-safe additive / screen"]
    H --> I
    I --> J["逆 primaries + TRC encode"]
    J --> K["输出 knee · 8/16-bit 蓝噪声抖动<br/>32-bit 不量化 · alpha 原样复制"]
```

## Apply 与恢复

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant M as main.jsx
    participant B as schema v2 bindings
    participant I as Imaging API
    participant C as core/WASM

    U->>M: 选择 source 并点击 Apply
    M->>M: createLayer 创建空白像素 target
    alt target 创建或寻址失败
        M-->>U: 中止；不写 source
    else target 可寻址
        M->>I: 从 source 按行带读取 RGBA
        I->>C: 从原始 source 渲染
        C-->>I: 量化后的 RGBA，alpha 不变
        I->>I: 一次 putPixels 到 target
        M->>B: 保存 document/source/target 指纹
    end
    U->>M: 重开或修改参数
    M->>B: 严格解析 id/指纹；歧义则要求重新绑定
    M->>I: 再次从 source 渲染 target
```
